    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0506 (Chemical Manufactures and Products Unenumerated). Attested in: 1866 British Customs Commodities List (Danika / HGIS Lab), P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 108, Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 227."@en ;
